  "sn45.179:1.1": "Pañcimāni bhikkhave orambhāgiyāni saṃyojanāni || ",
  "sn45.179:1.2": "katamāni pañca || || ",
  "sn45.179:1.3": "Sakkāyadiṭṭhi vicikicchā sīlabbataparāmāso kāmacchando byāpādo || ",
  "sn45.179:1.4": "imāni kho bhikkhave pañcorambhāgiyāni saṃyojanāni || || ",
  "sn45.179:1.5": "Imesam kho bhikkhave pañcannam orambhāgiyānaṃ saṃyojānanam abhiññāya pariññāya parikkhayāya pahānāya || pa || ayam ariyo aṭṭhaṅgiko maggo bhāvetabbo ",
  "sn45.179:1.6": "ti || || 2. "
}
